    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract provider of symmetric encryption keys. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implementations may delegate to an HSM, AWS KMS, HashiCorp Vault, or a static in-memory key (see <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1storage_1_1_static_key_provider" kindref="compound">StaticKeyProvider</ref></computeroutput>). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
